lyNkqe3g","date":"2021-06-19T19:51:07","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9102046489715576,"text_excerpt":"I really like the French Truck Coffee local chain and this one is in a great spot and has some really friendly staff! Fully stocked with a nice selection of munchies and a wide array of coffee choices you can't go wrong. don't forget about iced tea - mmmmmmm."},{"business_id":"dq_B8fJB1oPo645xkwPSKQ","review_id":"yuRwXaYDfoFRsOmhSlnwTA","date":"2020-12-24T16:08:13","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9099435806274414,"text_excerpt":"If you haven't tried French Truck Coffee, you are missing out. Although the coffee is good, the food is awesome. From the press sandwiches, soups and pastries, everything is fresh and delicious. Also, the employees are super nice and helpful. There are plenty places to sit inside and out. There are even some big garage doors that can be open when the weather is nice. Give them a try, you won't be disappointed."}],"visual":[{"business_id":"dq_B8fJB1oPo645xkwPSKQ","photo_id":"JdOew1JxobzIGkCsKH6WRw","label":"outside","image_url":"/photos/JdOew1JxobzIGkCsKH6WRw.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.9073590636253357},{"business_id":"dq_B8fJB1oPo645xkwPSKQ","photo_id":"_B0Ds_QeLDzeA5LRqA3kWA","label":"drink","image_url":"/photos/_B0Ds_QeLDzeA5LRqA3kWA.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.9073587656021118}]},"notebook_case":null}
